REQUIRES: system-windows
XFAIL: *

A 64-bit process starting a 32-bit program (SysWOW64's cmd.exe) still runs
it through catter.
Known failures: #124 (32-bit programs fail to start).

RUN: %e2e probe wow64 | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe wow64 | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS wow64
